# Agent skill copies — ONLY .agents/skills is canonical.
# Do not use `npx skills add --all` in this repo; it clones into 70+ tool folders.
# Prefer: npx skills add <pkg> --agent '*' --copy -y  then keep only .agents,
# or install with a single agent target that writes under .agents.
